"""

WORKER = 'worker'
REVIEWER = 'reviewer'
"""What a spawn asks the multiplexer for, in the port's words.

A worker gets room of its own. A reviewer goes directly under the pane it reviews,
because the two are read against each other -- so the caller names itself as the
